My name is Farhad Deelon Wijaya, and I am currently a final-year student pursuing a Bachelor of Digital Enterprise Management. This survey is conducted as part of my Final Year Project (FYP), which aims to examine the impact of artificial intelligence (AI) on students’ critical thinking. 

The survey is anonymous and will take approximately 6-7 minutes to complete. All responses will be treated with strict confidentiality and will be used solely for academic purposes. 

Your honest participation is greatly appreciated. 
https://forms.office.com/r/vdnRDM6rng

Thank you for your time and cooperation.‬" data-testid="last-msg-status"><div class="x1c4vz4f x3nfvp2 xuce83p x1bft6iq x1i7k8ik xq9mrsl x6s0dn4"><div class="x78zum5"><span dir="auto" class="x1rg5ohu _ao3e" style="min-height: 0px;">~Aaa</span></div></div><span>:&nbsp;</span><span dir="ltr" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu _ao3e" style="min-height: 0px;">Hi Everyone,

My name is Farhad Deelon Wijaya, and I am currently a final-year student pursuing a Bachelor of Digital Enterprise Management. This survey is conducted as part of my Final Year Project (FYP), which aims to examine the impact of artificial intelligence (AI) on students’ critical thinking.&nbsp;

The survey is anonymous and will take approximately 6-7 minutes to complete. All responses will be treated with strict confidentiality and will be used solely for academic purposes.&nbsp;

Your honest participation is greatly appreciated.&nbsp;
https://forms.office.com/r/vdnRDM6rng

