AI and automation are changing how people work, build, and solve problems. But knowing where to start is often the hardest part.

This workshop gives you that starting point.
Through the OpenClaw Workshop, you’ll hear directly from the community leads at Morpheus (a decentralized AI ecosystem) and learn how it’s reshaping the way people access and use AI.

Instead of relying on traditional paid models, Morpheus introduces concepts like staking tokens to access AI compute, opening up new possibilities for developers and builders. You’ll also see how this can be integrated with tools like OpenClaw to automate workflows and support real-world projects.

No prior experience with OpenClaw or decentralized AI? That’s completely fine.

🎤 Speakers
-Rene F Bernard
-Eric Chan
(Asia Community Leads @ Morpheus)

📅 27 April 2026
⏰ 7:00 PM – 9:30 PM
📍 Agmo Space, FCM 

🔗 Register here: https://luma.com/ao3ija21‬" data-testid="last-msg-status"><div class="x1c4vz4f x3nfvp2 xuce83p x1bft6iq x1i7k8ik xq9mrsl x6s0dn4"><div class="x78zum5"><span dir="auto" class="x1rg5ohu _ao3e" style="min-height: 0px;">~Jordan Ling</span></div></div><span>:&nbsp;</span><div class="x1rg5ohu x1c4vz4f x2lah0s xdl72j9 xhslqc4 x16dsc37 x1qx5ct2 x1p8j9ns" data-testid="chat-msg-symbol"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" height="20" width="18" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" class="" fill="currentColor"><title>ic-image</title><path d="M5 21C4.45 21 3.97917 20.8042 3.5875 20.4125C3.19583 20.0208 3 19.55 3 19V5C3 4.45 3.19583 3.97917 3.5875 3.5875C3.97917 3.19583 4.45 3 5 3H19C19.55 3 20.0208 3.19583 20.4125 3.5875C20.8042 3.97917 21 4.45 21 5V19C21 19.55 20.8042 20.0208 20.4125 20.4125C20.0208 20.8042 19.55 21 19 21H5ZM5 19H19V5H5V19ZM7 17H17C17.2 17 17.35 16.9083 17.45 16.725C17.55 16.5417 17.5333 16.3667 17.4 16.2L14.65 12.525C14.55 12.3917 14.4167 12.325 14.25 12.325C14.0833 12.325 13.95 12.3917 13.85 12.525L11.25 16L9.4 13.525C9.3 13.3917 9.16667 13.325 9 13.325C8.83333 13.325 8.7 13.3917 8.6 13.525L6.6 16.2C6.46667 16.3667 6.45 16.5417 6.55 16.725C6.65 16.9083 6.8 17 7 17Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div><span dir="ltr" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu _ao3e" style="min-height: 0px;">Morpheus–OpenClaw Workshop

AI and automation are changing how people work, build, and solve problems. But knowing where to start is often the hardest part.

This workshop gives you that starting point.
Through the OpenClaw Workshop, you’ll hear directly from the community leads at Morpheus (a decentralized AI ecosystem) and learn how it’s reshaping the way people access and use AI.

Instead of relying on traditional paid models, Morpheus introduces concepts like staking tokens to access AI compute, opening up new possibilities for developers and builders. You’ll also see how this can be integrated with tools like OpenClaw to automate workflows and support real-world projects.

